[
 {
  "section": "HOOK",
  "start": 0.0
 },
 {
  "text": "You wake up and check your bank app.",
  "section": "HOOK",
  "start": 0.0,
  "end": 1.441,
  "chunk": 0
 },
 {
  "text": "One billion dollars.",
  "section": "HOOK",
  "start": 1.441,
  "end": 1.981,
  "chunk": 0,
  "pause_after": 1.313
 },
 {
  "text": "Nobody knows.",
  "section": "HOOK",
  "start": 3.425,
  "end": 3.836,
  "chunk": 1
 },
 {
  "text": "Not your boss.",
  "section": "HOOK",
  "start": 3.836,
  "end": 4.453,
  "chunk": 1
 },
 {
  "text": "Not your family.",
  "section": "HOOK",
  "start": 4.453,
  "end": 5.07,
  "chunk": 1,
  "pause_after": 0.318
 },
 {
  "text": "Not even the cashier who just smiled at you.",
  "section": "HOOK",
  "start": 5.42,
  "end": 7.192,
  "chunk": 2,
  "pause_after": 0.213
 },
 {
  "text": "The latest Forbes list counted three thousand four hundred and twenty-eight billionaires.",
  "section": "HOOK",
  "start": 7.426,
  "end": 11.528,
  "chunk": 3,
  "pause_after": 0.208
 },
 {
  "text": "You would be the one missing from the list.",
  "section": "HOOK",
  "start": 11.757,
  "end": 13.267,
  "chunk": 4,
  "pause_after": 0.215
 },
 {
  "text": "So what do you do with a secret that big?",
  "section": "HOOK",
  "start": 13.504,
  "end": 15.147,
  "chunk": 5,
  "pause_after": 0.742
 },
 {
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 15.963
 },
 {
  "text": "Your first problem is almost funny.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 15.963,
  "end": 17.157,
  "chunk": 6,
  "pause_after": 0.227
 },
 {
  "text": "You can't buy anything without someone noticing.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 17.407,
  "end": 19.057,
  "chunk": 7
 },
 {
  "text": "A new car gets questions.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 19.057,
  "end": 20.235,
  "chunk": 7,
  "pause_after": 0.338
 },
 {
  "text": "A new house gets louder questions.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 20.607,
  "end": 21.719,
  "chunk": 8,
  "pause_after": 0.327
 },
 {
  "text": "Even a fancier lunch starts a rumour, if you've eaten the same sandwich for years.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 22.079,
  "end": 25.856,
  "chunk": 9,
  "pause_after": 0.415
 },
 {
  "text": "The money isn't loud.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 26.312,
  "end": 27.177,
  "chunk": 10
 },
 {
  "text": "The spending is.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 27.177,
  "end": 27.825,
  "chunk": 10
 },
 {
  "text": "And you don't need to spend.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 27.825,
  "end": 29.122,
  "chunk": 10,
  "pause_after": 0.389
 },
 {
  "text": "A billion dollars earning a careful four percent a year makes forty million dollars.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 29.55,
  "end": 33.403,
  "chunk": 11,
  "pause_after": 0.232
 },
 {
  "text": "Every year.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 33.658,
  "end": 34.293,
  "chunk": 12,
  "pause_after": 0.476
 },
 {
  "text": "That's over a hundred thousand dollars a day, and the billion stays untouched.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 34.816,
  "end": 37.543,
  "chunk": 13,
  "pause_after": 0.24
 },
 {
  "text": "So day one is about restraint.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 37.807,
  "end": 38.814,
  "chunk": 14
 },
 {
  "text": "You go to work.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 38.814,
  "end": 39.485,
  "chunk": 14,
  "pause_after": 0.341
 },
 {
  "text": "You say \"fine\" when someone asks how you are.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 39.86,
  "end": 41.375,
  "chunk": 15,
  "pause_after": 0.321
 },
 {
  "text": "You walk past the nice watch in the window.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 41.727,
  "end": 43.615,
  "chunk": 16
 },
 {
  "text": "You test it, of course.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 43.615,
  "end": 44.663,
  "chunk": 16,
  "pause_after": 0.213
 },
 {
  "text": "A small thing first.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 44.898,
  "end": 45.883,
  "chunk": 17
 },
 {
  "text": "A coffee you don't price-check.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 45.883,
  "end": 47.114,
  "chunk": 17,
  "pause_after": 0.35
 },
 {
  "text": "Then a bigger one: you take the better seat on the train.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 47.499,
  "end": 49.69,
  "chunk": 18,
  "pause_after": 0.269
 },
 {
  "text": "Nobody reacts.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 49.986,
  "end": 50.476,
  "chunk": 19
 },
 {
  "text": "That's the unsettling part.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 50.476,
  "end": 51.457,
  "chunk": 19,
  "pause_after": 0.3
 },
 {
  "text": "The biggest change in your life, and the world doesn't blink.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 51.787,
  "end": 53.703,
  "chunk": 20,
  "pause_after": 0.375
 },
 {
  "text": "Then, around midnight, you notice something worse.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 54.115,
  "end": 55.686,
  "chunk": 21
 },
 {
  "text": "Hiding the money is easy.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 55.686,
  "end": 56.807,
  "chunk": 21,
  "pause_after": 0.254
 },
 {
  "text": "Hiding what it does to you is harder.",
  "section": "THE FIRST DAY",
  "start": 57.087,
  "end": 58.249,
  "chunk": 22,
  "pause_after": 0.953
 },
 {
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 59.298
 },
 {
  "text": "Two real stories show both sides of this.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 59.298,
  "end": 60.971,
  "chunk": 23,
  "pause_after": 0.36
 },
 {
  "text": "In November twenty twenty-two, a single ticket in California won a Powerball jackpot of two point oh four billion dollars.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 61.367,
  "end": 66.707,
  "chunk": 24,
  "pause_after": 0.416
 },
 {
  "text": "The winner took the cash option.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 67.164,
  "end": 68.622,
  "chunk": 25
 },
 {
  "text": "Just under a billion dollars.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 68.622,
  "end": 69.837,
  "chunk": 25,
  "pause_after": 0.292
 },
 {
  "text": "Almost exactly your situation.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 70.158,
  "end": 71.814,
  "chunk": 26
 },
 {
  "text": "Anonymous?",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 71.814,
  "end": 72.228,
  "chunk": 26,
  "pause_after": 0.53
 },
 {
  "text": "No.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 72.811,
  "end": 73.248,
  "chunk": 27,
  "pause_after": 0.427
 },
 {
  "text": "In California, a lottery winner's name is public record.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 73.718,
  "end": 75.81,
  "chunk": 28,
  "pause_after": 0.368
 },
 {
  "text": "A few months later, the state named him publicly.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 76.215,
  "end": 78.321,
  "chunk": 29
 },
 {
  "text": "He declined every interview.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 78.321,
  "end": 79.257,
  "chunk": 29,
  "pause_after": 0.393
 },
 {
  "text": "Some rules don't care how private you want to be.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 79.689,
  "end": 82.145,
  "chunk": 30
 },
 {
  "text": "Now the other story.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 82.145,
  "end": 83.127,
  "chunk": 30,
  "pause_after": 1.324
 },
 {
  "text": "Chuck Feeney co-founded a duty-free shopping empire.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 84.583,
  "end": 86.916,
  "chunk": 31,
  "pause_after": 0.328
 },
 {
  "text": "Then he gave away more than eight billion dollars, mostly in secret.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 87.276,
  "end": 90.417,
  "chunk": 32,
  "pause_after": 0.385
 },
 {
  "text": "His foundation didn't carry his name.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 90.84,
  "end": 92.041,
  "chunk": 33,
  "pause_after": 0.304
 },
 {
  "text": "For years, staff reportedly couldn't tell their families where they worked.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 92.375,
  "end": 94.826,
  "chunk": 34,
  "pause_after": 0.213
 },
 {
  "text": "His name only came out in nineteen ninety-seven.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 95.06,
  "end": 96.861,
  "chunk": 35,
  "pause_after": 0.342
 },
 {
  "text": "He kept giving while he was alive, until the money was gone.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 97.237,
  "end": 99.279,
  "chunk": 36,
  "pause_after": 0.381
 },
 {
  "text": "The foundation closed in twenty twenty.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 99.698,
  "end": 101.301,
  "chunk": 37,
  "pause_after": 0.285
 },
 {
  "text": "He died three years later, at ninety-two.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 101.614,
  "end": 103.377,
  "chunk": 38,
  "pause_after": 0.205
 },
 {
  "text": "So a secret billion can be put to work.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 103.602,
  "end": 105.267,
  "chunk": 39,
  "pause_after": 0.237
 },
 {
  "text": "The harder question is what it does to the person holding it.",
  "section": "IT HAS HAPPENED, IN MINIATURE",
  "start": 105.528,
  "end": 107.693,
  "chunk": 40,
  "pause_after": 0.751
 },
 {
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 108.518
 },
 {
  "text": "\"No one knows\" is almost never literally true.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 108.518,
  "end": 110.29,
  "chunk": 41,
  "pause_after": 0.228
 },
 {
  "text": "Secret from the world is not the same as secret from the system.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 110.541,
  "end": 112.804,
  "chunk": 42,
  "pause_after": 0.286
 },
 {
  "text": "In the United States, banks must verify who their customers are, and watch accounts for unusual activity.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 113.118,
  "end": 117.111,
  "chunk": 43,
  "pause_after": 0.218
 },
 {
  "text": "A billion dollars is exactly the kind of number a compliance team reads twice.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 117.35,
  "end": 121.192,
  "chunk": 44,
  "pause_after": 0.321
 },
 {
  "text": "So the bank knows.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 121.545,
  "end": 122.448,
  "chunk": 45
 },
 {
  "text": "Your accountant knows.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 122.448,
  "end": 123.125,
  "chunk": 45,
  "pause_after": 0.38
 },
 {
  "text": "A lawyer knows, the moment you give anything away through a fund.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 123.544,
  "end": 125.973,
  "chunk": 46,
  "pause_after": 0.261
 },
 {
  "text": "The tax authority will want a word too, because a billion dollars doesn't file itself.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 126.26,
  "end": 129.611,
  "chunk": 47,
  "pause_after": 0.279
 },
 {
  "text": "Call it a circle of five or six people.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 129.917,
  "end": 131.235,
  "chunk": 48,
  "pause_after": 0.411
 },
 {
  "text": "Paid to stay quiet, bound by confidentiality, and not one of them invited to your birthday.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 131.687,
  "end": 135.375,
  "chunk": 49,
  "pause_after": 0.239
 },
 {
  "text": "That's the shape of a secret fortune.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 135.638,
  "end": 136.798,
  "chunk": 50,
  "pause_after": 0.251
 },
 {
  "text": "A wall of professionals who know everything, and a crowd of people you love who know nothing.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 137.074,
  "end": 141.086,
  "chunk": 51,
  "pause_after": 0.33
 },
 {
  "text": "And then there are the tells.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 141.448,
  "end": 142.798,
  "chunk": 52
 },
 {
  "text": "You stop glancing at prices.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 142.798,
  "end": 143.923,
  "chunk": 52,
  "pause_after": 0.201
 },
 {
  "text": "You say \"whatever's fine\" a little too quickly.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 144.144,
  "end": 146.453,
  "chunk": 53
 },
 {
  "text": "Secrets rarely leak through the paperwork.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 146.453,
  "end": 148.184,
  "chunk": 53,
  "pause_after": 0.281
 },
 {
  "text": "They leak through habits.",
  "section": "WHO ALREADY KNOWS",
  "start": 148.494,
  "end": 149.475,
  "chunk": 54,
  "pause_after": 1.17
 },
 {
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 150.762
 },
 {
  "text": "The strange gift is this.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 150.762,
  "end": 151.592,
  "chunk": 55,
  "pause_after": 0.313
 },
 {
  "text": "If nobody knows, nobody treats you differently.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 151.937,
  "end": 153.613,
  "chunk": 56,
  "pause_after": 0.349
 },
 {
  "text": "Your friends are exactly who they were yesterday.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 153.997,
  "end": 155.689,
  "chunk": 57
 },
 {
  "text": "But you aren't.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 155.689,
  "end": 156.323,
  "chunk": 57,
  "pause_after": 0.398
 },
 {
  "text": "You're carrying a fact you can't share, and a secret is heavy in a particular way.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 156.761,
  "end": 160.256,
  "chunk": 58,
  "pause_after": 0.392
 },
 {
  "text": "Tell one person, and it stops being a secret.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 160.687,
  "end": 162.804,
  "chunk": 59
 },
 {
  "text": "It becomes a risk.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 162.804,
  "end": 163.745,
  "chunk": 59,
  "pause_after": 0.286
 },
 {
  "text": "So you start doing the maths on everyone you love.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 164.06,
  "end": 166.442,
  "chunk": 60
 },
 {
  "text": "Who'd be thrilled?",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 166.442,
  "end": 167.157,
  "chunk": 60,
  "pause_after": 0.521
 },
 {
  "text": "Who'd ask for a loan?",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 167.729,
  "end": 168.579,
  "chunk": 61,
  "pause_after": 0.512
 },
 {
  "text": "Who would quietly go cold?",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 169.142,
  "end": 170.291,
  "chunk": 62,
  "pause_after": 0.542
 },
 {
  "text": "Researchers have a clue about what money does to a mind.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 170.887,
  "end": 172.685,
  "chunk": 63,
  "pause_after": 0.275
 },
 {
  "text": "Swedish economists followed lottery winners for years, because lotteries hand out wealth at random.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 172.987,
  "end": 177.141,
  "chunk": 64,
  "pause_after": 0.2
 },
 {
  "text": "Winners worked a little less.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 177.361,
  "end": 178.435,
  "chunk": 65,
  "pause_after": 0.575
 },
 {
  "text": "But their satisfaction with life stayed higher for more than a decade.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 179.068,
  "end": 182.009,
  "chunk": 66,
  "pause_after": 0.206
 },
 {
  "text": "Their daily happiness and mental health moved far less.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 182.235,
  "end": 184.363,
  "chunk": 67,
  "pause_after": 0.335
 },
 {
  "text": "Wealth made people rate their lives better.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 184.732,
  "end": 186.021,
  "chunk": 68,
  "pause_after": 0.255
 },
 {
  "text": "It didn't make every morning feel better.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 186.302,
  "end": 187.602,
  "chunk": 69,
  "pause_after": 0.28
 },
 {
  "text": "Treat that as a clue, not a prediction.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 187.91,
  "end": 189.399,
  "chunk": 70
 },
 {
  "text": "A billion is a different animal.",
  "section": "THE PEOPLE PROBLEM",
  "start": 189.399,
  "end": 190.515,
  "chunk": 70,
  "pause_after": 0.892
 },
 {
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 191.496
 },
 {
  "text": "Week two, you leave a huge tip on a small bill.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 191.496,
  "end": 193.196,
  "chunk": 71,
  "pause_after": 0.303
 },
 {
  "text": "The waiter stares at the receipt, then at you.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 193.528,
  "end": 195.441,
  "chunk": 72
 },
 {
  "text": "You shrug and leave.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 195.441,
  "end": 196.291,
  "chunk": 72,
  "pause_after": 0.219
 },
 {
  "text": "It's the best part of your month, and he'll be telling that story for years.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 196.532,
  "end": 199.71,
  "chunk": 73,
  "pause_after": 0.275
 },
 {
  "text": "By week four, the novelty has worn thin.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 200.013,
  "end": 201.85,
  "chunk": 74,
  "pause_after": 0.382
 },
 {
  "text": "You've checked the balance more times than you'd admit.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 202.27,
  "end": 204.196,
  "chunk": 75
 },
 {
  "text": "So you try a bigger experiment.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 204.196,
  "end": 205.48,
  "chunk": 75,
  "pause_after": 0.205
 },
 {
  "text": "A lawyer sets up a fund, and your parents' mortgage vanishes.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 205.706,
  "end": 207.859,
  "chunk": 76,
  "pause_after": 0.316
 },
 {
  "text": "They assume the bank made a mistake.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 208.207,
  "end": 209.606,
  "chunk": 77
 },
 {
  "text": "You let them.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 209.606,
  "end": 210.206,
  "chunk": 77
 },
 {
  "text": "A stranger's surgery gets paid for.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 210.206,
  "end": 211.406,
  "chunk": 77,
  "pause_after": 0.319
 },
 {
  "text": "A stranger who never learns who did it.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 211.757,
  "end": 213.497,
  "chunk": 78
 },
 {
  "text": "It feels better than any purchase.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 213.497,
  "end": 214.802,
  "chunk": 78,
  "pause_after": 0.316
 },
 {
  "text": "That's the problem, because now you want more of it.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 215.15,
  "end": 217.12,
  "chunk": 79,
  "pause_after": 0.39
 },
 {
  "text": "And you discover the limit of secret giving.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 217.549,
  "end": 219.308,
  "chunk": 80,
  "pause_after": 0.257
 },
 {
  "text": "The more you give, the harder it is to stay invisible.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 219.591,
  "end": 221.837,
  "chunk": 81,
  "pause_after": 0.237
 },
 {
  "text": "People ask where help came from.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 222.097,
  "end": 223.519,
  "chunk": 82
 },
 {
  "text": "Paperwork leaves trails.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE MONTH",
  "start": 223.519,
  "end": 224.23,
  "chunk": 82,
  "pause_after": 1.005
 },
 {
  "section": "AFTER ONE YEAR",
  "start": 225.335
 },
 {
  "text": "A year in, the numbers are stubborn.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE YEAR",
  "start": 225.335,
  "end": 226.347,
  "chunk": 83,
  "pause_after": 0.273
 },
 {
  "text": "At a careful four percent, your billion has earned another forty million, even after everything you've given.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE YEAR",
  "start": 226.646,
  "end": 230.367,
  "chunk": 84,
  "pause_after": 0.379
 },
 {
  "text": "The pile grew while you were busy giving it away.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE YEAR",
  "start": 230.783,
  "end": 232.442,
  "chunk": 85,
  "pause_after": 0.388
 },
 {
  "text": "Feeney needed decades and a whole organisation to move eight billion dollars out the door.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE YEAR",
  "start": 232.868,
  "end": 237.085,
  "chunk": 86,
  "pause_after": 0.38
 },
 {
  "text": "You are one person with a lawyer and a lunch break.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE YEAR",
  "start": 237.503,
  "end": 239.631,
  "chunk": 87,
  "pause_after": 0.25
 },
 {
  "text": "Around month eleven, you realise you haven't felt rich once.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE YEAR",
  "start": 239.906,
  "end": 242.788,
  "chunk": 88
 },
 {
  "text": "You've only felt careful.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE YEAR",
  "start": 242.788,
  "end": 243.941,
  "chunk": 88,
  "pause_after": 0.278
 },
 {
  "text": "So the real choice shows up.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE YEAR",
  "start": 244.247,
  "end": 245.307,
  "chunk": 89,
  "pause_after": 0.206
 },
 {
  "text": "You can stay the quiet, ordinary person you are, with a very large number you rarely mention.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE YEAR",
  "start": 245.534,
  "end": 249.225,
  "chunk": 90,
  "pause_after": 0.257
 },
 {
  "text": "Or you can tell someone, accept the risk, and build something bigger than the secret.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE YEAR",
  "start": 249.508,
  "end": 252.374,
  "chunk": 91,
  "pause_after": 0.41
 },
 {
  "text": "Both are honest answers.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE YEAR",
  "start": 252.825,
  "end": 253.625,
  "chunk": 92
 },
 {
  "text": "Only one of them is lonely.",
  "section": "AFTER ONE YEAR",
  "start": 253.625,
  "end": 254.826,
  "chunk": 92,
  "pause_after": 0.796
 },
 {
  "section": "THE QUESTION",
  "start": 255.701
 },
 {
  "text": "Back at the till, the cashier smiles again.",
  "section": "THE QUESTION",
  "start": 255.701,
  "end": 257.412,
  "chunk": 93,
  "pause_after": 0.41
 },
 {
  "text": "This time you smile back, and you're the only person in the shop who knows why.",
  "section": "THE QUESTION",
  "start": 257.863,
  "end": 261.477,
  "chunk": 94,
  "pause_after": 0.249
 },
 {
  "text": "Maybe that's the point.",
  "section": "THE QUESTION",
  "start": 261.751,
  "end": 262.687,
  "chunk": 95
 },
 {
  "text": "Money changes what you can do.",
  "section": "THE QUESTION",
  "start": 262.687,
  "end": 264.091,
  "chunk": 95,
  "pause_after": 0.243
 },
 {
  "text": "It doesn't tell you who to be.",
  "section": "THE QUESTION",
  "start": 264.359,
  "end": 265.522,
  "chunk": 96
 },
 {
  "text": "So here is the real question.",
  "section": "THE QUESTION",
  "start": 265.522,
  "end": 266.519,
  "chunk": 96,
  "pause_after": 0.337
 },
 {
  "text": "If money changed nothing anyone could see, what would you change?",
  "section": "THE QUESTION",
  "start": 266.89,
  "end": 269.221,
  "chunk": 97,
  "pause_after": 2.0
 }
]